editor_description = "Two-bone IK pulling the right hand onto a target, aimed by HandIKPole unless the caller brings a pole of its own. Used where an animation alone will not put the hand where the world needs it, such as a grip on a ledge or a handlebar, and in first person, where Player.set_first_person_hand_targets points it at the camera's FirstPersonRightHand for a gun or at a bow's string hand marker for the draw."
